  unitName: Zeus Bow Loch
  unitId: 40164
  unitNumber: 250
  description: "One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna. In the final showdown with the gods attacking Palmyna, Loch played
    a vital role, and it was he who struck the final blow against the commander of
    the gods. Unfortunately, Edea was gravely wounded trying to protect Loch in battle.
    Legend has it that, in a fit of rage, Loch unleashed an attack that shook the
    world\u2019s very foundations."
  summonDesc: My arrows are god killers. <br>What will you do with such<br>power
    at your disposal?
  fusionDesc: Hahaha!<br>My anger is increases with my strength.<br>The gods will
    pay for what they did!
  evoDesc: Can you feel it?<br>The soul residing within my arrow.<br>This is the
    true Loch!
  element: 4
  rarity: 4
